diff --git a/package/ffmpeg/0006-avcodec-pcm-bluray-dvd-Use-correct-pointer-types-on-.patch b/package/ffmpeg/0006-avcodec-pcm-bluray-dvd-Use-correct-pointer-types-on-.patch
